            "id": "314427573",
            "include_tags": true,
            "locked": false,
            "message": "{{#is_alert}}\n## P1 · API availability — error budget burn (fast)\n**WHAT:** Error budget for API availability is being consumed 14.4× faster than sustainable, confirmed over 1h and still true over the last 5m.\n**WHERE:** {{value}} · env `prod` · region `global`\n**SERVICE:** `api-services` (api / slo, tier0)\n**BUSINESS IMPACT:** Customer-facing objective at risk. At the current rate the 30d budget is exhausted well before the window ends.\n**WHY IT TRIGGERED:** Multi-window burn rate: the long window (1h) proves the burn is sustained rather than a spike, and the short window (5m) means it is still happening now. Both must be true, which is what makes burn-rate alerting both fast and quiet.\n**OWNER:** application-development · support 24x7 · this pages the on-call rotation\n**RUNBOOK:** attached to this monitor as `SLO Error Budget Burn` — open it from the monitor's Runbook asset.\n**AUTOMATED DIAGNOSTICS:** workflow `auto-major-incident` has run; its output is attached to this event.\n**RELATED EVENTS:** correlated on `api-services.prod.api-services` — deployments, infrastructure changes and platform events from the last 30 minutes are attached as context.\n**SLO / ERROR BUDGET:** `slo-api-availability` · this condition consumes error budget\n{{/is_alert}}\n{{#is_warning}}\n## API availability — error budget burn (fast) — warning\nApproaching the alert condition on {{value}}. Investigate before it becomes P1.\n{{/is_warning}}\n{{#is_no_data}}\n## API availability — error budget burn (fast) — NO DATA\nTelemetry stopped arriving for {{value}}. Treat this as a telemetry-health incident: an unmonitored resource is worse than an alerting one.\n{{/is_no_data}}\n{{#is_recovery}}\n## Recovered · API availability — error budget burn (fast)\n{{value}} returned to normal. Error-budget impact recorded against `slo-api-availability`. No action required; the correlation group closes when every child recovers.\n{{/is_recovery}}\n{{#is_warning_recovery}}\nWarning cleared for {{value}}.\n{{/is_warning_recovery}}",
            "monitor_threshold_windows": [],
            "monitor_thresholds": [
              {
                "critical": "14.4",
                "critical_recovery": "",
                "ok": "",
                "unknown": "",
                "warning": "",
                "warning_recovery": ""
              }
            ],
            "name": "[P1][prod][api] API availability — error budget burn (fast) (critical)",
            "new_group_delay": 0,
            "new_host_delay": 300,
            "no_data_timeframe": 0,
            "notification_preset_name": "",
            "notify_audit": false,
            "notify_by": [],
            "notify_no_data": false,
            "on_missing_data": "",
