            "message": "{{#is_alert}}\n## P3 · .NET Gen2 Collection Anomaly\n**WHAT:** Gen2 collections are the expensive ones. A rising gen2 rate against the service's own baseline is the .NET signature of a leak or of large-object churn, well before memory looks alarming.\n\n**WHERE:** {{value}} · env `prod` · region `global`\n**SERVICE:** `application-platform` (application / service, tier0)\n**BUSINESS IMPACT:** Nothing is broken yet. A boundary will be crossed if nobody acts within the lead time this monitor provides.\n**WHY IT TRIGGERED:** The signal deviated from its own learned baseline by more than the configured number of deviations — not because it crossed a fixed number.\n**OWNER:** sre · support 24x7 · this does not page\n**RUNBOOK:** attached to this monitor as `.NET Gen2 Collection Anomaly` — open it from the monitor's Runbook asset.\n**AUTOMATED DIAGNOSTICS:** workflow `diag-app-health` has run; its output is attached to this event.\n**RELATED EVENTS:** correlated on `application.prod.application-platform` — deployments, infrastructure changes and platform events from the last 30 minutes are attached as context.\n**SLO / ERROR BUDGET:** `slo-app-availability` · this condition consumes error budget\n{{/is_alert}}\n{{#is_warning}}\n## .NET Gen2 Collection Anomaly — warning\nApproaching the alert condition on {{value}}. Investigate before it becomes P3.\n{{/is_warning}}\n{{#is_no_data}}\n## .NET Gen2 Collection Anomaly — NO DATA\nTelemetry stopped arriving for {{value}}. Treat this as a telemetry-health incident: an unmonitored resource is worse than an alerting one.\n{{/is_no_data}}\n{{#is_recovery}}\n## Recovered · .NET Gen2 Collection Anomaly\n{{value}} returned to normal. Error-budget impact recorded against `slo-app-availability`. No action required; the correlation group closes when every child recovers.\n{{/is_recovery}}\n{{#is_warning_recovery}}\nWarning cleared for {{value}}.\n{{/is_warning_recovery}}",
            "monitor_threshold_windows": [],
            "monitor_thresholds": [
              {
                "critical": "1",
                "critical_recovery": "",
                "ok": "",
                "unknown": "",
                "warning": "",
                "warning_recovery": ""
              }
            ],
            "name": "[P3][prod][application] .NET Gen2 Collection Anomaly (critical)",
            "new_group_delay": 300,
            "new_host_delay": 300,
            "no_data_timeframe": 0,
            "notification_preset_name": "",
            "notify_audit": false,
            "notify_by": [],
