            "id": "314986534",
            "include_tags": true,
            "locked": false,
            "message": "{{#is_alert}}\n## P2 · JVM Garbage Collection Pause Degradation\n**WHAT:** Major (old-generation) collection time only. Minor collections are constant and cheap; it is the major collections that stop the world long enough for callers to time out.\n\n**WHERE:** {{value}} · env `prod` · region `global`\n**SERVICE:** `application-platform` (application / service, tier0)\n**BUSINESS IMPACT:** The service still functions but measurably worse; a subset of traffic or users is failing.\n**WHY IT TRIGGERED:** The signal changed faster than the configured percentage relative to its own recent history. Speed of degradation, not absolute level.\n**OWNER:** sre · support 24x7 · this does not page\n**RUNBOOK:** attached to this monitor as `JVM Garbage Collection Pause Degradation` — open it from the monitor's Runbook asset.\n**AUTOMATED DIAGNOSTICS:** workflow `diag-app-health` has run; its output is attached to this event.\n**RELATED EVENTS:** correlated on `application.prod.application-platform` — deployments, infrastructure changes and platform events from the last 30 minutes are attached as context.\n**SLO / ERROR BUDGET:** `slo-app-latency` · this condition consumes error budget\n{{/is_alert}}\n{{#is_warning}}\n## JVM Garbage Collection Pause Degradation — warning\nApproaching the alert condition on {{value}}. Investigate before it becomes P2.\n{{/is_warning}}\n{{#is_no_data}}\n## JVM Garbage Collection Pause Degradation — NO DATA\nTelemetry stopped arriving for {{value}}. Treat this as a telemetry-health incident: an unmonitored resource is worse than an alerting one.\n{{/is_no_data}}\n{{#is_recovery}}\n## Recovered · JVM Garbage Collection Pause Degradation\n{{value}} returned to normal. Error-budget impact recorded against `slo-app-latency`. No action required; the correlation group closes when every child recovers.\n{{/is_recovery}}\n{{#is_warning_recovery}}\nWarning cleared for {{value}}.\n{{/is_warning_recovery}}",
            "monitor_threshold_windows": [],
            "monitor_thresholds": [
              {
                "critical": "100",
                "critical_recovery": "",
                "ok": "",
                "unknown": "",
                "warning": "50",
                "warning_recovery": ""
              }
            ],
            "name": "[P2][prod][application] JVM Garbage Collection Pause Degradation (critical)",
            "new_group_delay": 300,
            "new_host_delay": 300,
            "no_data_timeframe": 0,
            "notification_preset_name": "",
            "notify_audit": false,
            "notify_by": [],
            "notify_no_data": false,
