            "message": "{{#is_alert}}\n## P3 · Backup Older Than Policy\n**WHAT:** Backup Older Than Policy: backup_age signal detected by threshold analysis.\n**WHERE:** {{value}} · env `prod` · region `global`\n**SERVICE:** `backup-platform` (infrastructure / backup_job, tier0)\n**BUSINESS IMPACT:** Nothing is broken yet. A boundary will be crossed if nobody acts within the lead time this monitor provides.\n**WHY IT TRIGGERED:** 26 hours encodes the contractual 24-hour RPO plus a 2-hour grace window. The number IS the control.\n\n**OWNER:** infrastructure-engineering · support 24x7 · this does not page\n**RUNBOOK:** attached to this monitor as `Backup Older Than Policy` — open it from the monitor's Runbook asset.\n**AUTOMATED DIAGNOSTICS:** workflow `auto-compliance-ticket` has run; its output is attached to this event.\n**RELATED EVENTS:** correlated on `backup-platform.prod.backup-platform` — deployments, infrastructure changes and platform events from the last 30 minutes are attached as context.\n**SLO / ERROR BUDGET:** `slo-infra-backup-success` · this condition consumes error budget\n{{/is_alert}}\n{{#is_warning}}\n## Backup Older Than Policy — warning\nApproaching the alert condition on {{value}}. Investigate before it becomes P3.\n{{/is_warning}}\n{{#is_no_data}}\n## Backup Older Than Policy — NO DATA\nTelemetry stopped arriving for {{value}}. Treat this as a telemetry-health incident: an unmonitored resource is worse than an alerting one.\n{{/is_no_data}}\n{{#is_recovery}}\n## Recovered · Backup Older Than Policy\n{{value}} returned to normal. Error-budget impact recorded against `slo-infra-backup-success`. No action required; the correlation group closes when every child recovers.\n{{/is_recovery}}\n{{#is_warning_recovery}}\nWarning cleared for {{value}}.\n{{/is_warning_recovery}}",
