            "id": "314986424",
            "include_tags": true,
            "locked": false,
            "message": "{{#is_alert}}\n## P2 · Service Bus Incoming Message Collapse\n**WHAT:** A queue that stops RECEIVING is as broken as one that stops draining, and it is invisible to every depth-based monitor — depth simply goes to zero, which looks healthy.\n\n**WHERE:** {{value}} · env `prod` · region `global`\n**SERVICE:** `messaging-platform` (messaging / messaging_namespace, tier0)\n**BUSINESS IMPACT:** The service still functions but measurably worse; a subset of traffic or users is failing.\n**WHY IT TRIGGERED:** The signal changed faster than the configured percentage relative to its own recent history. Speed of degradation, not absolute level.\n**OWNER:** cloud-engineering · support 24x7 · this does not page\n**RUNBOOK:** attached to this monitor as `Service Bus Incoming Message Collapse` — open it from the monitor's Runbook asset.\n**AUTOMATED DIAGNOSTICS:** workflow `diag-messaging` has run; its output is attached to this event.\n**RELATED EVENTS:** correlated on `messaging.prod.messaging-platform` — deployments, infrastructure changes and platform events from the last 30 minutes are attached as context.\n**SLO / ERROR BUDGET:** `slo-messaging-delivery` · this condition consumes error budget\n{{/is_alert}}\n{{#is_warning}}\n## Service Bus Incoming Message Collapse — warning\nApproaching the alert condition on {{value}}. Investigate before it becomes P2.\n{{/is_warning}}\n{{#is_no_data}}\n## Service Bus Incoming Message Collapse — NO DATA\nTelemetry stopped arriving for {{value}}. Treat this as a telemetry-health incident: an unmonitored resource is worse than an alerting one.\n{{/is_no_data}}\n{{#is_recovery}}\n## Recovered · Service Bus Incoming Message Collapse\n{{value}} returned to normal. Error-budget impact recorded against `slo-messaging-delivery`. No action required; the correlation group closes when every child recovers.\n{{/is_recovery}}\n{{#is_warning_recovery}}\nWarning cleared for {{value}}.\n{{/is_warning_recovery}}",
            "monitor_threshold_windows": [],
            "monitor_thresholds": [
              {
                "critical": "-70",
                "critical_recovery": "",
                "ok": "",
                "unknown": "",
                "warning": "-50",
                "warning_recovery": ""
              }
            ],
            "name": "[P2][prod][messaging] Service Bus Incoming Message Collapse (critical)",
            "new_group_delay": 300,
            "new_host_delay": 300,
            "no_data_timeframe": 0,
            "notification_preset_name": "",
            "notify_audit": false,
            "notify_by": [],
            "notify_no_data": false,
            "on_missing_data": "",
            "priority": "2",
            "query": "pct_change(avg(last_15m),last_4h):sum:azure.servicebus_namespaces.incoming_messages{env:prod,alert_band:critical} by {namespace}.as_rate() \u003c -70",
            "renotify_interval": 30,
