            "locked": false,
            "message": "{{#is_alert}}\n## P3 · API Rate Limit Saturation\n**WHAT:** API Rate Limit Saturation: saturation signal detected by forecast analysis.\n**WHERE:** {{value}} · env `prod` · region `global`\n**SERVICE:** `api-services` (api / service, tier2)\n**BUSINESS IMPACT:** Nothing is broken yet. A boundary will be crossed if nobody acts within the lead time this monitor provides.\n**WHY IT TRIGGERED:** Extrapolating the recent trend, this resource is projected to cross its limit inside the forecast horizon. It has not crossed it yet — that is the point.\n**OWNER:** application-development · support business-hours · this does not page\n**RUNBOOK:** attached to this monitor as `API Rate Limit Saturation` — open it from the monitor's Runbook asset.\n**AUTOMATED DIAGNOSTICS:** workflow `auto-capacity-ticket` has run; its output is attached to this event.\n**RELATED EVENTS:** correlated on `api-gateway.prod.api-services` — deployments, infrastructure changes and platform events from the last 30 minutes are attached as context.\n**SLO / ERROR BUDGET:** `slo-api-availability` · this condition consumes error budget\n{{/is_alert}}\n{{#is_warning}}\n## API Rate Limit Saturation — warning\nApproaching the alert condition on {{value}}. Investigate before it becomes P3.\n{{/is_warning}}\n{{#is_no_data}}\n## API Rate Limit Saturation — NO DATA\nTelemetry stopped arriving for {{value}}. Treat this as a telemetry-health incident: an unmonitored resource is worse than an alerting one.\n{{/is_no_data}}\n{{#is_recovery}}\n## Recovered · API Rate Limit Saturation\n{{value}} returned to normal. Error-budget impact recorded against `slo-api-availability`. No action required; the correlation group closes when every child recovers.\n{{/is_recovery}}\n{{#is_warning_recovery}}\nWarning cleared for {{value}}.\n{{/is_warning_recovery}}",
            "monitor_threshold_windows": [],
            "monitor_thresholds": [
              {
                "critical": "0.9",
                "critical_recovery": "",
                "ok": "",
                "unknown": "",
                "warning": "0.75",
                "warning_recovery": ""
              }
            ],
            "name": "[P3][prod][api] API Rate Limit Saturation (standard)",
            "new_group_delay": 300,
            "new_host_delay": 300,
            "no_data_timeframe": 0,
            "notification_preset_name": "",
            "notify_audit": false,
            "notify_by": [],
            "notify_no_data": false,
            "on_missing_data": "",
            "priority": "3",
            "query": "max(next_1d):forecast(sum:api.gateway.requests{env:prod,alert_band:standard,service_archetype:api} by {service}.as_rate() / avg:api.gateway.rate_limit{env:prod,alert_band:standard,service_archetype:api} by {service}, 'linear', 1, interval='15m', history='2d') \u003e 0.9",
